  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8404.02 Maintaining Information in State Police Online Telecommunication System",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8404.02 Maintaining Information in State Police Online Telecommunication System.\n\n(a) The director shall enter application information into SPOTS of applications that have been granted.\n\n(b) Within 30 calendar days of receiving a completed DSSP 472 or DSSP 473, the director shall update the information in SPOTS.\n\n(c) Within 30 calendar days of receiving a DSSP 474 “Withdrawal From Contact Person Notification Program Form” with section 1 or 2 completed, the director shall remove the participating person from SPOTS. Within 30 calendar days of receiving a DSSP 474 with section 3 completed, the director shall remove the contact person from SPOTS.\n\nSource. #14340, eff 8-14-25, EXPIRES: 8-14-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c8400.html"
